#### 3.2. Absolute Prohibition of App Store & Repository Distribution
To prevent trademark, policy, and liability disputes, **distribution through public application stores is strictly forbidden**. Except for the Original Author (`choiceNew`), **no person or entity is permitted under any name (including but not limited to using the original app name, a modified name, a renamed package, or as a fork/derivative)** to package, submit, publish, or distribute this software or derivative builds to any public application store or distribution platform, including but not limited to:
