3. **Redress Solely Against Distributor**: Any third party or end user experiencing damages, losses, or legal claims arising from a third-party distributed build must seek remedies solely and directly from that third-party distributor.

#### 3.4. Prohibition of API Key & Private Endpoint Abuse
Third-party builds and distributions must NOT abuse or bundle the Original Author's private API keys, proprietary Cloudflare endpoints, or private ad-unit credentials. Third-party deployers must configure their own credentials.

